Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 20:32:39 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(mcp): regenerate operations made stale during generate
 all

Check freshness in program order instead of freezing the stale target list.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2439
